# Private trainer notes/drafts (local only, never published).
# NOTE the leading slash: it anchors these to the repository root. A bare
# `notes/` matches ANY directory named `notes` at any depth -- which silently
# excluded reveal.js's own `slides/builders_files/libs/revealjs/plugin/notes/`,
# leaving the published deck unable to initialise.
